        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "TECHNOLOGY CHANGE COMMITTEE",
            "block_bbox": [
                490,
                147,
                779,
                166
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    490.0,
                    146.99998474121094
                ],
                [
                    778.0,
                    146.99998474121094
                ],
                [
                    778.0,
                    164.99998474121094
                ],
                [
                    490.0000305175781,
                    164.99998474121094
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Company and the Union recognize that technological changes in equipment, organization, or methods of operation have a tendency to affect job security and the nature of the work to be performed. The parties, therefore, will attempt to diminish or abolish the detrimental effects of any such technological change by creating a joint committee to be known as the Technology Change Committee to oversee problems and recommend solutions of problems in this area as set forth below.",
            "block_bbox": [
                351,
                173,
                910,
                297
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    351.0,
                    173.0
                ],
                [
                    910.0,
                    173.0
                ],
                [
                    910.0,
                    297.0
                ],
                [
                    351.0,
                    297.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) Such Committee will consist of not more than six (6) representatives of the Company and not more than six (6) representatives of the Unions (3 CWA, 3 IBEW). Such committee may be convened at the option of either party at mutually agreeable times.",
            "block_bbox": [
                385,
                309,
                910,
                381
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    385.0,
                    309.0
                ],
                [
                    910.0,
                    309.0
                ],
                [
                    910.0,
                    381.0
                ],
                [
                    385.0,
                    381.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) The purpose of the Committee is to provide for discussion of technological changes (including changes in equipment, organization, or methods or operation) which may affect employees represented by the Unions. The Company will notify the Unions at lease six (6) months in advance of planned technological changes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                385,
                393,
                910,
                484
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    385.0,
                    393.0
                ],
                [
                    910.0,
                    393.0
                ],
                [
                    910.0,
                    484.0
                ],
                [
                    385.0,
                    484.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Meetings of the Committee will be held as soon thereafter as can be mutually arranged. At such meetings, the Company will advise the Unions of its plans with respect to the introduction of such changes and will familiarize the Unions with the progress being made.",
            "block_bbox": [
                417,
                496,
                908,
                568
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    417.0,
                    496.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    496.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    568.0
                ],
                [
                    417.0,
                    568.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) The impact and effect of such changes on the employees shall be appropriate matters for discussion. The Company will discuss with the Unions:",
            "block_bbox": [
                385,
                580,
                907,
                633
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
